  "Q0_matches_P23": true,
  "difference_limit": "sigma_diff=-(s_out-s_in)/(4*pi*a); smooth s_out=s_in -> 0 (P24-1 check i); mirror flip of side 2 in the wormhole sum recovers the sum form; P24-1 sigma_diff formula reproduced by construction"
 },
